# electron-builder's output directory — multi-hundred-MB .dmg/.zip
# installer artifacts, entirely irrelevant to the Vercel web deployment
# (the desktop app is a separate build, not part of what gets deployed
# here). Already covered by .gitignore, but Vercel's own upload scanner
# doesn't appear to honor .gitignore the same way for every path, so
# it's listed explicitly here too — a nearly identical issue with
# src-tauri/target (the old Tauri shell's build output) caused a "File
# size limit exceeded (100 MB)" deploy failure previously.
release
